text = "A crack in the rock quickly expands into a shaft disappearing into the darkness below.

At the bottom is a new chamber. Half-finished statues litter the cave floor: animal parts, human faces, and shapes none of you recognize.

One of these stands out in particular: a peculiarly accurate heart carved from a single piece of stone. A crack in the rock quickly expands into a shaft disappearing into the darkness below. A crack in the rock quickly expands into a shaft disappearing into the darkness below."
fit_content = true
visible_characters_behavior = 1
tooltip_directions = Array[int]([5, 0, 1, 3])

